<title>USA: SEQUUS says Amphotec cleared in Italy.</title>
<headline>SEQUUS says Amphotec cleared in Italy.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>SEQUUS Pharmaceuticals Inc said on Wednesday that its anti-fungal Amphotec has been approved in Italy under the trade name Amphocil.</p>
<p>The approval brings to 16 the number of countries in which Amphotec has been authorized for sale, SEQUUS said.</p>
<p>The drug is pending review by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration.</p>
<p>Amphotec will be marketed and sold in Italy by Zeneca Group Plc under its distribution agreement with SEQUUS.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1733</p>
</text>
